        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1293464}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">积攒电荷</div><div class="s">暴怒云气给自己叠增伤，每层 8%，最多 3 层 <span class="tag magic">魔法增益</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:278326}}" alt="">吞噬魔法 <span class="pill p-imm">偷增益</span></div>
