          <div class="why">读条时开，疾影两层都在冷却就黑暗</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291262}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">闪电箭</div><div class="s">灌注能量的唤雷者读条 <span class="tag fel">自然</span><span class="tag">单体</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:183752}}" alt="">瓦解 <span class="pill p-clr">打断</span></div>
          <div class="why">这一段打断全给唤雷者</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">3</div>
