        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:266923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">镀流 · 拦尖塔光束</div><div class="s">站进光束挡住充能，每 0.5 秒一跳，物理易伤 250% <span class="tag fel">自然</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198589}}" alt="">疾影 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">进光束就开，10 秒盖住一轮站位</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:266923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">镀流 · 疾影刚交过</div><div class="s">下一轮光束又轮到你 <span class="tag fel">自然</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:196718}}" alt="">黑暗 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">每一跳少一成，和疾影轮着开</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">这一关疾影和黑暗<b>全给拦光束</b>。诱导读完全队吃一下，地上的力场每秒一跳，先走出来再进光束。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>加瓦兹特 → 塞塔里斯的化身</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 宝珠守望者、神庙干扰者、无信援兵、不羁的火花</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303486}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">蚀骨践踏</div><div class="s">宝珠守望者读条，60 码新星 + 10 秒持续伤害 <span class="tag fel">自然</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
