        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300877}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">腐化</div><div class="s">碰生命之力后 15 秒，治疗 −33%，物理易伤 250%，可叠加 <span class="tag magic">暗影</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198589}}" alt="">疾影 · 黑暗 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
