          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198589}}" alt="">疾影 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">冲到你就开，10 秒盖住整段</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300704}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">锁定</div><div class="s">一批无信折磨者锁定最近的治疗跑过去 <span class="tag">点名</span><span class="tag">多目标</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1234195}}" alt="">虚空新星 <span class="pill p-cc">昏迷 2 秒</span></div>
