        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1302158}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">烈焰震击</div><div class="s">扭曲的妖术师读条，一发 + 8 秒灼烧 <span class="tag fel">火焰</span><span class="tag">单体</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:183752}}" alt="">瓦解 <span class="pill p-clr">打断</span></div>
          <div class="why">这一场的打断都给妖术师</div>
        </div>
      </div>
