  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">05</span>工具箱</h2>
  <p class="sub">金框是这个副本的核心技能。</p>
  <div class="tools">
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:198589}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">疾影</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤 25% · 两层</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>震地、阵风、锯齿冲锋、雷霆喷吐、释放电荷、镀流光束、蚀骨践踏、腐化、邪恶冲锋</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>全团技能读条时按，点名技能上身就按；点了恶魔韧性有两层</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:278326}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">吞噬魔法</div><span class="pill p-imm">偷增益</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>暴怒云气身上的积攒电荷</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>云气读完积攒电荷就偷，雷云段转好就用</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:217832}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">禁锢</div><span class="pill p-cc">瘫痪 · 挨打会断</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>流沙猎手的箭雨引导；宝珠守望者身边的神庙干扰者</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>箭雨一出来就点猎手</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:183752}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">瓦解</div><span class="pill p-clr">打断 · 远程</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>扰乱心智、闪电箭、毒箭、毒素喷吐、烈焰震击</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>扰乱心智最优先；断成了魔法伤害再降 15%</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:196718}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">黑暗</div><span class="pill p-dr">8 码 · 全队</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>疾影刚交过的那一轮光束、蚀骨践踏、释放电荷、压不住的腐化</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>和疾影错开用</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1234195}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">虚空新星</div><span class="pill p-cc">群体昏迷 2 秒</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>化身那场成批跑向治疗的无信折磨者</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>它们锁定治疗、挤成一团时</dd></dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">06</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">+22 高手同款噬灭天赋，英雄天赋 Annihilator。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1266307}}" alt=""><div><b>恶魔韧性</b><span>疾影多一层充能，释放电荷和光束轮着接</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:278326}}" alt=""><div><b>吞噬魔法</b><span>偷掉暴怒云气的积攒电荷</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:217832}}" alt=""><div><b>禁锢</b><span>停掉流沙猎手的箭雨</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1223171}}" alt=""><div><b>诡计</b><span>瓦解、吞噬魔法施法距离多 20 码，后排够得着风暴能手和云气</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1266329}}" alt=""><div><b>恶魔笼头</b><span>瓦解打断成功后 12 秒魔法伤害降低 15%</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:389783}}" alt=""><div><b>漆黑</b><span>黑暗冷却缩短，光束和践踏都能和疾影错开交</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1234195}}" alt=""><div><b>虚空新星</b><span>群体昏迷 2 秒，晕住无信折磨者</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:389696}}" alt=""><div><b>伊利达雷的知识</b><span>受到的魔法伤害降低，这本几乎全是法术伤害</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/rL6J8cZhbHQ2zxVD#fight=10">Midnightmess 28:08（时间轴）</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/MgwRWBNCxrp1nPAq#fight=12">蟆蛤小 29:06（天赋）</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/VwyZq2zBgH9mTvL4#fight=15">Isirys 29:14</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
<footer><div class="wrap">噬灭恶魔猎手 · 塞塔里斯神庙 应对手册 · 2026-11</div></footer>
<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
    var t=code.textContent.trim();
    function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
    if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
